=== Mob loot ===
[[Zombie]]s, [[husk]]s, [[skeleton]]s, [[stray]]s, [[bogged]] and [[piglin]]s have a small chance to spawn wearing armor, which may include golden armor. There is a 8.5% chance (9.5% with [[Looting]] I, 10.5% with Looting II and 11.5% with Looting III) for the mob to drop the armor they're wearing upon death unless they are spawned from an [[ominous trial spawner]]. The dropped armor are usually badly damaged, and may be [[enchanted]] with enchantment levels 5-19.

== Usage==
{{main|Armor#Usage}}
Wearing golden armor reduces damage taken from [[Armor#Damage types|most damage types]] and pacifies [[piglin]]s.

