=== Piglins ===
In [[Java Edition]], piglins are neutral toward players wearing at least one piece of golden armor. As of [[Java Edition 1.21.2|1.21.2]], this behavior is controlled by the <code>piglin_safe_armor</code> [[tag]], which includes golden armor by default, allowing data packs to designate other armor types as safe. In [[Bedrock Edition]], piglins are neutral only toward players wearing golden armor.

All pieces of golden armor can also be used to distract piglins. Piglins equip them, prioritizing it over all other armor materials, after inspecting them.<!--

-->{{#lst:Leather Armor|Equipping}}

